msgstr "Dicatat untuk %(count)s kontrak. Gaji baru mulai %(day)s; sampai saat itu tidak ada yang berubah, dan Anda dapat membatalkannya sampai hari itu."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "Taken back. Nobody's pay changed, and the review is approved again."
msgstr "Dibatalkan. Gaji siapa pun tidak berubah, dan tinjauan kembali berstatus disetujui."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "Taken back: pay review %s"
msgstr "Dibatalkan: tinjauan gaji %s"

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid ""
"Tell the pay team: they can work out any difference by hand on the next pay "
"run."
msgstr "Beri tahu tim penggajian: mereka dapat menghitung selisihnya secara manual pada penggajian berikutnya."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pb_pay_scales.field_pb_pay_apply__pbs_change_id
msgid ""
"The dated amount-change record written with this pay, read by proration and "
"the Past-month re-work."
msgstr "Catatan perubahan jumlah bertanggal yang ditulis bersama gaji ini, dibaca oleh proporsi dan perhitungan ulang bulan lalu."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid ""
"The new pay starts on %(day)s, so this can no longer be taken back. To move "
"the pay again, make a pay change."
msgstr "Gaji baru mulai %(day)s, jadi ini tidak dapat dibatalkan lagi. Untuk mengubah gaji lagi, buat perubahan gaji."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid ""
"The paid months have no pay scheme on them, so they cannot be re-worked "
"here."
msgstr "Bulan yang sudah dibayar tidak memiliki skema gaji, jadi tidak dapat dihitung ulang di sini."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/static/src/js/review_dated.js:0
msgid "The re-work could not be opened."
msgstr "Perhitungan ulang tidak dapat dibuka."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "Their contract ends before the new pay starts."
msgstr "Kontrak mereka berakhir sebelum gaji baru dimulai."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "Their contract is no longer running, so nothing was written for them."
msgstr "Kontrak mereka sudah tidak berjalan, jadi tidak ada yang ditulis untuk mereka."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid ""
"Their pay changed since the review was applied (now %s), so nothing was "
"written for them."
msgstr "Gaji mereka berubah sejak tinjauan diterapkan (sekarang %s), jadi tidak ada yang ditulis untuk mereka."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "This change starts in a month already paid."
msgstr "Perubahan ini dimulai pada bulan yang sudah dibayar."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid ""
"This review has already been applied. Take it back first if you need to "
"change it."
msgstr "Tinjauan ini sudah diterapkan. Batalkan dulu jika Anda perlu mengubahnya."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "This review is being applied right now. Look again in a minute."
msgstr "Tinjauan ini sedang diterapkan. Lihat lagi dalam satu menit."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid ""
"This review's new pay has not started yet. Close it after it starts, or take"
" it back."
msgstr "Gaji baru tinjauan ini belum dimulai. Tutup setelah dimulai, atau batalkan."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pb_pay_scales.selection__pb_pay_apply__state__scheduled
msgid "Waiting for its day"
msgstr "Menunggu harinya"

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "You can take it back until %(day)s, on one button."
msgstr "Anda dapat membatalkannya sampai %(day)s, dengan satu tombol."

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "One person was not written on the day:"
msgstr "Satu orang tidak ditulis pada hari itu:"

#. module: pb_pay_scales
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_pay_scales/models/review_dated.py:0
msgid "One person was paid for %(months)s before their new pay was written."
msgstr "Satu orang sudah dibayar untuk %(months)s sebelum gaji barunya ditulis."
